"""
OCR pipeline using Qwen2.5-VL with few-shot prompting for handwritten
scientific/technical notes (text, LaTeX math, chemical structures, tables).

Stages:
    1. OCR        -> transcribe target image using few-shot examples
    2. Evaluate   -> WER scoring against ground truth (written to wer_report.txt)
    3. Critique   -> a second LLM pass checks rule adherence (written to critique_report.txt)

All intermediate noise (raw prompts, full token dumps) is suppressed.
Only final artifacts are written to disk.
"""
